{
  "meta": {
    "name": "Isocline — Paper & Instrument",
    "version": "2026.10.10",
    "spec": "docs/design/ISOCLINE_DESIGN_SYSTEM.html",
    "notes": [
      "Canonical design tokens for every Isocline surface that is NOT the live app engine: web pages, docs, and Isocline Research print.",
      "Recipes mirror ThemePalette.resolve (xT/Managers/ThemeManager.swift). Each appearance is [L, C, hueOffset]; hue = seedHue + hueOffset, gamut-clamped by chroma reduction (ThemeEngine.clampToGamut).",
      "Edit this file, then run: python3 -I tools/scripts/gen_isocline_tokens.py — it rewrites the 'resolved' block plus tokens/isocline.css, docs/research/isocline.sty, and xTTests/IsoclineTokenExpectations.swift.",
      "Recipes tagged with an 'app' field exist in ThemePalette today and are parity-tested; 'paper' and 'card' are new and land in the app in roadmap phase 1."
    ]
  },
  "seed": {
    "defaultHex": "#D4537E",
    "source": "ThemeManager.defaultSeedHue = oklch(#D4537E).H",
    "stops": {
      "from": "default",
      "count": 8,
      "stepDegrees": 45,
      "role": "Quick swatches in the hue picker and the alternate-icon set (I2/I4) use the same stops; resolved.seedStops lists them."
    }
  },
